# =============================================================================
# OpenELIS common.properties — SANDBOX
#
# GENERATED SHAPE: this is upstream's common.properties with only the keys
# below changed. Do not trim it. Several OpenELIS beans (odooClient, the SAML
# config, freezer monitoring, BMP notifications) inject these properties with
# no default, so a missing key fails the whole Spring context at startup — and
# the symptom is a silent "Context startup failed", not a clear error.
#
# Overridden here:
#   server.ssl.*, encryption.general.password   keystore from .env
#   org.openelisglobal.remote.*                 INBOUND: poll the bridge for orders
#   org.openelisglobal.fhir.subscriber*         OUTBOUND: push results to the bridge
#
# Rendered by scripts/render-config.sh into openelis/generated/, which is
# mounted as the `common.properties` docker secret.
# =============================================================================

